<title>SPAIN: Private consumption seeing slow recovery - BoS.</title>
<headline>Private consumption seeing slow recovery - BoS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private consumption is consolidating its slow recovery and investment in capital goods is on an expansive path, the Bank of Spain said in its November report.</p>
<p>&quot;Private consumption is consolidating its slow path, and capital goods growth continues to show expansive behaviour,&quot; the report said.</p>
</text>
